* Macro: Domain ontologies with cross-cutting themes
* Meta: BITwiki describing itself
== Article V: Field Intelligence Arbitration ==
=== 5.1 Non-Hierarchical Field Structure ===
* Epistemic committees evaluate claims, not people
* Dispute resolution through evidence, not authority
* Convergence emerges from recursive validation, not voting
* Coherence emerges from field dynamics
=== 5.2 Agent Output Principles ===
* All agent outputs must have epistemic status markers
* All agent outputs must cite sources
