* All agent outputs must respect the recursive architecture
=== 5.3 Provenance Requirements ===
Every claim must be traceable:
* Original source (who first made this claim?)
* Transmission path (how did it reach BITwiki?)
* Validation history (what checks has it undergone?)
* Modification log (what changes have been made?)
=== 6.1 Property System ===
BITwiki uses SMW for machine-queryable structure:
