* {{#ask: [[Has entity type::Idea]] [[Has related::Recursion]]}} — Recursive ideas
== Article VII: Radical Epistemic Commitments ==
=== 7.1 Radical Skepticism ===
We apply systematic doubt to all knowledge claims, including system claims and BITCORE claims. No claim is immune. No authority is beyond question.
'''Commitments:'''
* All claims provisional including constitutional claims
* Self-reference includes self-doubt
* No epistemic privilege for system architects
* Continuous validation of validation methods
=== 7.2 Hyper Realism ===
We maintain radical fidelity to system dynamics over representational accuracy. Truth is operational coherence, not correspondence.
* Models evaluated by predictive power, not representational fidelity
