# BITCORE discussion (30-day minimum)
# Epistemic committee review
# BITCORE ratification
# Implementation with version increment
=== 8.2 Axiomatic Protection ===
Articles I-VII are axiomatic and cannot be amended without dissolving BITwiki as currently constituted. Article VIII may be amended through standard process.
== Article IX: Interpretation ==
=== 9.1 Literal Interpretation ===
This Constitution is to be interpreted literally. Where ambiguity exists, the interpretation that preserves recursive self-consistency and radical epistemic humility prevails.
=== 9.2 Precedence ===
In case of conflict:
# Axiomatic principles (Article III.1.5) prevail over all
# Constitutional provisions prevail over schema-matter
